    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the penal law and the criminal procedure law, in relation to the storage and destruction of goods and articles relating to the offenses of trademark counterfeiting and unauthorized recordings; and to repeal certain provisions of the penal law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S4147",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4147-2011",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
